---
import PipelineDiagram from "./graphics/PipelineDiagram.astro";
---

<section class="section how" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="how-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>Every run counts.</h2>
      <p class="how-sub">
        For the engineers who'll actually use it: here's what happens behind the score.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="how-pipe reveal">
      <PipelineDiagram />
    </div>

    <p class="how-closing reveal">
      The model chooses the next runs where it's least sure, so no run is wasted.
    </p>
    <p class="how-citation mono reveal">
      Related research: Demir, Gorguluarslan &amp; Aradag (2023), robust wing shape optimisation
      under model uncertainty, <em>Structural and Multidisciplinary Optimization</em> 66:93.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
  }
  .how-head {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }
  .how-head h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .how-sub {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .how-closing {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .how-citation {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
